 *
 * Version 0.1 (99/04/15):
 *		- first version
 *
 * Version 0.2 (99/06/16):
 *		- added kernel timer watchdog ping after close
 *		  since the hardware does not support watchdog shutdown
 *
 * Version 0.3 (99/06/21):
